  postHeader: 
  postContent: "Every week, tabloids churn out lurid details of A-list breakups to
    outdo competitors\u2014rarely following up on reputable statements or offering
    context beyond gossip.\n"
  funFact_Hint: "Notice whether the story\u2019s aim is to excite rather than inform.\n"
